<title>THAILAND: Industrial Finance Corp Q3 up 31 pct.</title>
<headline>Industrial Finance Corp Q3 up 31 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for three and nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     1.31	 vs	  1.00</p>
<p>    Net profit	   715.45	 vs	546.45</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     4.21	 vs	  3.48</p>
<p>    Net profit	    2,292	 vs	 1,898</p>
<p>NOTE:  Revs/shrs not stated. Company's full name is The Industrial Finance Corp of Thailand.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-2529950-3</p>
</text>
